WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
This matter cannot be cleared up at all

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
The lawyer’s letter will only further anger netizens

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Let them hold on to you

4
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,000
And Miko

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
The post was made by someone else

6
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Public opinion is spread by others

7
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,000
His hands are clean

8
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Just the fact that you slapped him

9
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
You can't beat him legally

10
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,350
But won't they still talk about me in school?

11
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,350
The discussion at school doesn't matter at all now

12
00:00:19,350 --> 00:00:20,350
What's important

13
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,350
When the director is backing you up

14
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,580
What will be found?

15
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:24,580
The best way now

16
00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:26,580
Just pay to have the post taken down

17
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:28,580
And block related keywords for you

18
00:00:28,580 --> 00:00:30,580
Seal this matter from the source

19
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:34,110
But I'm not willing

20
00:00:34,110 --> 00:00:35,110
He understands you

21
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:36,110
But you can't understand him

22
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:38,110
he knows how to piss you off

23
00:00:38,110 --> 00:00:39,110
But you can only be passively provoked

24
00:00:39,110 --> 00:00:42,110
In the end, Jingyi fell into this trap step by step.

25
00:00:42,110 --> 00:00:44,400
Learn to be calmer

26
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:47,140
Is this Miko you talking about?

27
00:00:47,140 --> 00:00:48,650
mark my words

28
00:00:48,650 --> 00:00:49,650
from now on

29
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:50,650
no matter where

30
00:00:50,650 --> 00:00:52,650
You need to be better at disguising your motives

31
00:00:52,650 --> 00:00:53,650
hide one's emotions

32
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:54,940
No matter what others think of you

33
00:00:54,940 --> 00:00:56,940
Keep your gentle and friendly attitude

34
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:59,320
You even have to learn some of Miko's skills

35
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,320
spirit of self sacrifice

36
00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,320
Don't let anyone

37
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:03,320
Got your handle

38
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:12,420
Study Miko?

39
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:14,520
The fourth male protagonist appears

40
00:01:14,520 --> 00:01:16,520
Jiang Xuchen
